  181                   
  182                   / Read a line of ascii characters into the memory address passed in the IO register.
  183                   / One character is placed in each word.
  184                   / The line is terminated by the null character, 0, and the line terminatior (nl or cr) dropped  185 01025 001025      .
  186                   / The memory area is not bounds checked!
  187                   / The current DCS2 channel is used.
  188                   / If an error occurs, the IO register will have the DCS2 rcs error code, else 0.
  189                   / The AC register is preserved.
  190                   / Call via jda getaln.
  191                   
  192                   
  193                   
  194                   
  195                   
